Change: restic rewrite --(i)exclude* does not create empty directories

In the past, ``restic rewrite --(i)exclude*`` created empty directories when
these directories became empty as the result of any --exclude* actions.

``restic rewrite --(i)exclude*`` now does not create any empty directories
as the result of any --exclude* actions, but will keep any pre-existing empty
directories.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/21929
https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/21979
